  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28533001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水城结奈",
          "text": "要吃糖吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28533004",
              "text": "要"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28533003",
              "text": "不要"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28533002",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28533003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水城结奈",
          "text": "被直接拒绝了，不愧是我看中的人。\n作为奖励，请你吃糖好了——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28533004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水城结奈",
          "text": "身体很诚实，那，甜蜜抽奖开始了——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28533005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水城结奈",
          "text": "会抽到什么颜色的糖果呢……\n噢，粉色传说，是代表告白的超幸运色。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28533007",
              "text": "……你早就计划好了要抽粉色吧？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28533006",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28533007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水城结奈",
          "text": "被你发现了，没关系，那我就直接开始了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28533008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水城结奈",
          "text": "|101|，我很欣赏你，\n所以请放下手头的事，先陪我玩一下。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28533010",
              "text": "大人的世界可是很忙的哦？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28533009",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28533010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水城结奈",
          "text": "是什么讨厌的家伙在占用你的时间？\n告诉我，我会帮你把他们处理掉的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28533012",
              "text": "……没那么简单啦。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28533012",
              "text": "真是小孩子气的话。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28533011",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28533012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水城结奈",
          "text": "你这是在小看我吗？我可不是什么小孩子。\n按年龄说的话，是可以给你做「老婆」的年纪。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28533013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水城结奈",
          "text": "你很想叫的吧，那两个字？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
